From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:51:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): switch between queue and steer next to the send
 button

Choosing whether a message sent during a running turn queues or steers
meant a trip to Settings. A small button left of the send button now
shows the current default send behavior and flips it between queue and
steer. It writes the same app setting as Settings, so both stay in sync;
interrupt can still be picked in Settings and the switch shows it.

Fork-Change: F-16
